          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Each disposable Microclimate Body Pad effectively absorbs sweat and incontinence moisture away from the skin. The pad also helps protect bedding and linens during an incontinent episode. The Microclimate Body Pad not only traps moisture, but also allows air to pass through, protecting the patient's skin.</span></p>\n",
